Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（史前历史博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是坐到什么东东啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What am I sitting on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"世界之顶"  "河堤码头"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Top of the world? Dock of the bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想不出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  内裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, ew, undies! Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  谁的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, whose are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whose are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是乔伊的   一定是他的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey's. Got to be Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧  就是乔伊的  乔...伊的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, Joey's. They're Joe-Joe-Joey's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.95,0:00:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我生性龌龊  随便在别人家脱内裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm disgusting.I take my underwear off in other people's homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快拿走  你有病啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get them out of here. What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  好恶心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去啊  好...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take them! I got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你干嘛不敢碰  这是你自己的内裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, You can touch them. They're your underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  借步说话  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler? A word? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了  不想再帮你们说谎了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it! I'm tired of covering for you two. .
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种鸟事不能再发生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This has got to stop. Aah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还是白色紧身三角裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahh! And tighty-whiteys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你8岁吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you, 8?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  乔伊  感激不尽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Joey, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.71,0:01:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不情愿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not welcome, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们总是害我出丑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys keep embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天瑞秋在这的浴室  看到你的剃毛刀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yesterday, Rachel found your razor in our bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I didn't know what to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只好说是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so I said it was mine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还说我要在话剧里演女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and-and that I was playing a woman in a play.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果还得一不做二不休\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then one thing led to another and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  连脚踝周围都剃光了  那里很不好刮啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And around the ankles, that is a tough spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  告诉你们  我不能...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, It was. All right, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:01:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要说谎我们也不好受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All this lying has been hard on us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  不过至少你们有上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I bet all the sex makes it easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们下次一定会更小心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们实在太顺利了  所以还不想让别人知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we don't want everyone to know because this is going really well
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好就是保密才能这么顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and maybe the reason it's going really well is because it's a secret..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你觉得很怪  但我们都不太会处理感情问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know it sounds really weird, but we're so bad at relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  帮帮忙  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are. Help us. Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不过...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. But,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要跟我上一次床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you do it with me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  就知道你不肯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey! Didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第09集  罗斯的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E09 The One With Ross's Sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.45,0:02:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.72,0:03:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.91,0:03:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在看什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"呼啸山庄"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, Wuthering Heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在纽恩大学上文学课  明天之前必须看完第一章\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm taking a literature class at the New School and I have to finish it for the first session tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.09,0:03:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在上课  真酷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't know you were taking a class. That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次上拉梅兹的课很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really liked that Lamaze class I took.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我决定换堂课来上上   换个比较要用脑袋的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know and this time I thought I'd go for something, y'know a little more intellectual,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,期末考又不用那么痛苦的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with a less painful final exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来很有意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey that sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你也可以一起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! Oh, you should come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就有人可以跟我一起坐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah, Then I'll have someone to sit with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你有时间看书吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! Okay―ooh, but are you going to have time to read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我高中就读过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I read that in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is going to be so much fun! .
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘  先让我看完\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay-shhh, I have to finish
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你怎么啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's wrong, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.87,0:04:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有同事偷吃我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Someone at work ate my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,条子怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did the police say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是感恩节剩下的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My Thanksgiving leftover sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然给人偷吃掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe someone ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  不过是个三明治嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, It's just a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just a sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今年30岁  已经离婚两次  还没地方可住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I am 30 years old, okay? I'm about to be divorced twice and I just got evicted!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个三明治是我人生中  唯一美好的事物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That sandwich was the only good thing going on in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一美好的事物  竟然给人偷吃掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Someone ate the only good thing going on in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有材料可以再做一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have enough stuff for one more sandwich,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来自己要吃...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was going to eat it myself, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  真是谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mon, that would be incredible. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到现在还不相信有人偷吃了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still can't believe someone ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还留了一张纸条在上面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I left a note and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  谁啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Knock-knock." "Who's there?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯盖勒的午餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Ross Geller's lunch."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个罗斯盖勒的午餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Ross Geller's lunch, who?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是罗斯盖勒的午餐  请勿偷走我  好吗"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Ross Geller's lunch. Please don't take me. Okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没被扁  就该偷笑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm surprised you didn't go home wearing your lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不想让别人偷吃你的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look you wanna hold onto your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就得吓吓他们  这是我在街头流浪学到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gotta scare people off. I learned that living on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你会怎么说  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? So what would you say Pheebs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如 "脏手少碰我的馊水"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stuff like, uh, "Keep your mitts off my grub."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你以为菲比当年是在演《安妮》吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say Ross, when you picture Phoebe living on the street, is she surrounded by the entire cast of Annie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,贴上这张纸条就没人敢偷吃了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, This'll keep them away from your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa! Ohh!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你真狠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you are a badass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次再告诉你们  我拿刀捅条子的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Someday I'll, tell you about the time I stabbed the cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  是他先捅我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe. He stabbed me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布朗蒂姊妹是当代的杰出女性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The Bronte sisters were remarkable women for their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时是父系社会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They lived in a patriarchal society.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉迟到了  因为我出门太晚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry I'm late, but I left late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  这本书说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So Pheebs, what is the book about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你高中念过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Didn't you read it in high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  后来我想起我开始看时  正好碰上要为球队打气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well yeah, but then I remembered I started it and there was this pep rally and I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又是啦啦队的队长\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was on top of the pyramid .
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样啦  到底在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but anyway.umm, what is this book about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是凯西跟希克里夫的悲惨爱情故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, umm, It's a tragic love story between Cathy and Heathcliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,故事发生在英国一座恐怖的山庄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and umm, It takes place on these creepy moors in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,场景就代表  男主角性格中狂野的一面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which I think represent the wildness of Heathcliff's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对象征主义很有一套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I totally get symbolism.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书的主题是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How would you characterize the theme of this book?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看找谁  瑞秋葛林\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, let's see... Rachel Green?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个爱情悲剧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, well I would have to say that it's a tragic love story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常明显  不过你说得也没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's sort of a given...but, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁有意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有象征性的意义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, oh, oh. Symbolism!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狂野的场景...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And uh, the-the uh, wildness of the mores...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得反映出  男主角性格中桀骜的一面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}which I think is mirrored in the wildness of  Heathcliff's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋读得相当透彻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What Rachel has shrewdly observed here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.69,0:07:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就是照我说的回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You completely stole my answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  随便看看就知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, that was pretty obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哪晓得  你根本没看过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well how would you know? You didn't read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.57,0:07:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿蓝衬衫这位同学\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, you in the blue shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为这个问题  有很多可能的答案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that, um, yours is a question with many possible answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就麻烦你举出一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you care to venture one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意说一个吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you care to venture one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是重复我的话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you just repeating what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是重复我的话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you just repeating what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不直接说你没看过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why didn't you say you hadn't read the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望他认为我很蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because I didn't want him to think I was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看看你多蠢啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was really embarrassing, what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe! Phoebe! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那张纸条  真是了不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your note? Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不但没人敢碰我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not only did no one touch my sandwich...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还开始对我敬畏三分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but people at work are actually afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有人叫我 "疯子"  "疯子盖勒"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A guy called me "Mental.""Mental Geller."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直梦想有这种超酷的外号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've always wanted a cool nickname like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前你最酷的外号  就是 "尿裤子盖勒"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The best you got in high school was, uh, "Wet Pants Geller."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是饮水机喷到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was the water fountain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在有人愿意帮我写报告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway...people are writing reports for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱什么时候交就什么时候交\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...uh, pushing back deadlines to fit my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来对人耍狠  就可以呼风唤雨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I tell you, you get tough with people and you can get anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,崔比亚尼  咖啡拿来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Tribbiani! Give me that coffee! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天真有意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来还怀疑你会不会约我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been wondering if you'd ask me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在怀疑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you, uh, still wondering?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们刚刚才约过会啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. We just went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真聪明  我喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're smart.I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有蜡烛啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, candles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  毯子  摄影机  我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is that, a blanket?A video camera? Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样...等等啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信你竟然在第一次约会  就想拍下我们上床过程\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you thought you'd video tape us having sex on the first date!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.09,0:09:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  她刚说的...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, is what she just said, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你还真打算...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!You're actually gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且钱德还在家  你是...你变态吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And with Chandler in the next room. What are you, what are you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是乔伊啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就很恶心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I'm disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还拍低成本的色情片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I make low-budget adult films.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们答应我  要更小心的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys promised to be more careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊的好名声都给你们毁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, come on! The good Joey name is being dragged through the mud here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.60,0:10:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你们的事情说出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm telling everyone about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则内裤跟摄影机的事  只会让人觉得  我是变态猪啰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the only way to explain the underwear and the video camera that doesn't make me look like a pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:10:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不-不  等一下  一定有其他方法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no, wait! There's got to be a better explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以说你在拍色情片  因为你在...上色情片的课\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can tell them you had to make an adult film for your...adult film class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这理由还不错  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I like that. But no-no,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋在你家  发现我内裤的事又怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}how does that explain why Rachel found my underwear at your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你们得出柜承认了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, get ready to come out of the non-gay closet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你等等  我保证一定会想出理由\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, just wait, please.I promise to come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再让我们多缓几天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just give us a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  最好让我能保住面子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right Hey, but it better make me look really, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有...摄影机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and another thing, the video camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  可以跟你谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, Ross. May I have a word with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  唐诺\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course, Donald.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有同事抱怨你最近脾气火爆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've been getting reports of some very angry behavior on your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,写信威胁大家  拒绝按时交报告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Threatening letters..refusal to meet deadlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有人叫你是 "疯子"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Apparently people now call you Mental.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你找精神科医生谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We want you to speak to a psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不懂  其实是误会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. Uh, you...You don't understand. This is so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切要从我的三明治说起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, this is all just because of a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹非常会做火鸡三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see, my sister makes these amazing turkey sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的秘诀就是  多夹一片浸过肉汁的面包在中间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Her secret is, she puts an extra slice of gravy-soaked bread in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我称那片为 "多汁秘方"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I call it "The Moistmaker."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一次我把三明治放在冰箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, I put my sandwich in the fridge...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha-ha-ha. Oh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  应该是我吃掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.I believe I ate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吃了我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You ate my sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一时看错  谁都可能拿错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A simple mistake. It can happen to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你的三明治  也有"多汁秘方"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you confuse it with your own turkey sandwich with a Moistmaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:13:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  难道你没看到上面的纸条\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I...Do you, perhaps, remember...seeing a note on top of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为那是有人开玩笑  或是随手写的打油诗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There may have been a joke or limerick of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面清楚写着那是我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That said it was...my sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别激动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以到我办公室找找  可能垃圾筒里还有剩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come look in my office, some of it my still be in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个三明治很大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it was quite large.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须丢掉一大半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I-I-I-I-I had to throw most of it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你...丢掉我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You-you-you-you threw my sandwich away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书在讲什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So umm, What's this book about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本你也没看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You didn't read it, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来是要看  结果却看了其它的书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I was going to, but I, uh, accidentally read something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.86,0:13:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.03,0:13:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时尚杂志\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Vogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说这本《简爱》是在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, So tell me about Jane Eyre.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  你应该自己看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, You should've read it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  别这么假正经嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on Phoebe! don't be such a goody-goody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简爱呢  你会以为她是女人  其实不然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, all right. So Jane Eyre? First you'd think she's a woman, but she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是生化人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's a cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生化人  就是机器人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A cyborg? Isn't that like a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书在当时超级先进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, This book was light years ahead of its time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉迟到  开始上课吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry I'm late. Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家对《简爱》有何感想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, What did you think of Jane Eyre?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋刚跟我讨论过  她有些看法非常有趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, Rachel and I were discussing it, and she actually had very interesting insights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请说  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go ahead, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, thank you, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《简爱》最让我震惊的就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, well, What struck me most when reading Jane Eyre...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书非常惊世骇俗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...was, uh, how the book was so ahead of its time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你指的是女性主义  这么说也成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you're talking about feminism, I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有写到女性主义  不过还有机器人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, feminism, yes. But also the robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然上次拍摄不成功\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Since that video camera thing didn't work out...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先给你一点预告片段\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I thought that I would give you just a little preview.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在照片中没穿衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're naked in this picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天上班去看过精神医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saw a psychiatrist at work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我脾气太暴躁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On account of my rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且最近越来越严重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which, if I may say, right now is out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他开药丸给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He gave me a pill for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,药丸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A pill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医生说我对上司大吼大叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. When the psychiatrist told me to take a leave of absence...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以应该请假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I yelled at my boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.95,0:16:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又开始暴跳如雷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I started to get worked up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他要我吃颗镇定剂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So he offered me a tranquilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这主意不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I thought it was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就吃了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  他们逼你请假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute, They're making you take time off work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你也同意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.47,0:16:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚开始不工作可能不习惯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's going to be weird not having a job for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我已经不在乎三明治了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I definitely don't care about my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我丢脸丢大了  你竟然还让我一直说下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's so embarrassing! I can't believe you let me go on like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把简爱比成机器战警  实在太爆笑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was just so funny when you started comparing Jane Eyre to Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我太气了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I snapped, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不想好好上课\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You weren't taking the class seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  这有什么了不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, Come on! What is the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们就是一起出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought it'd be something we could do together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上课打发时间闹着玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I thought it would be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好玩很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah! Fun is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我也想学点东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but y'know I also wanted to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:17:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家老说在高中学东学西  我却没上过高中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People talk about what they learned in high school. I never went to high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你真的想学东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh. Oh, So you really wanted to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  菲比  我只想找点乐子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, y'know, Pheebs, I just wanted to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你该拉谁去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, you know who you should go with?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know! I know! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  问题是你提的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, you asked the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, that's Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样...你别误会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点  你这个大变态\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You get away from me, You sick, sick, sick, sick-o!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊有偷窥癖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey has got a secret peephole!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:17:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  他有摩妮卡的裸体照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! He has a naked picture of Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他拍下我们裸体的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He takes naked pictures of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还一边吃鸡块一边看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}then he eats chicken and looks at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看  那是我老妹啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look. Oh! Dude, that's my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我  等下  大家先别激动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me that! All right, Wait! Everybody just calm down. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要给我们的老友乔伊  有机会解释他为何如此变态\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's give our friend Joey a chance to explain why he's such a big pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是变态好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! I am not a pervert! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是...我...其实...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just...I just kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家听我说  我可以帮他解释\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, look! Look. I think I can explain this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊是性爱狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey's a sex addict.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  才怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  不怪你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay! It's good! It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是一种病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡说  我才不是性爱狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No! I am not a sex addict!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才能解释最近这一连串的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the only way to explain all this stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实不是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it isn't. No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也可以说出真相\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you could also explain it with the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么真相\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事  你在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟摩妮卡上床了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I slept with Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听听大家怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let's see what everybody thinks of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我老妹上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You slept with my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  只在伦敦发生过一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yes, but it was...We just did it once, uh, in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会让我开始抓狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is not good for my rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  是真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica.Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则怎么解释这些怪事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How else would you explain all the weird stuff that's been going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.93,0:19:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果只发生过一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but if it only happened that one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.07,0:19:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的内裤  怎么会出现在我们家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}how come we found your underwear in our apartment the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:20:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那件内裤是我当天在伦敦穿的  对不对  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was the underwear I was wearing that night in London. Right Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想留下来...当纪念品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I wanted to keep it...as a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God, Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定  乔伊  你确定你不是性爱狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure Joe? Are you sure you're not just a sex addict?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  要是有人是性爱狂  那也是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! If anyone's a sex addict here, it's Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  打我们从伦敦回来  她就想再勾引我上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. She has been trying to get me back in the sack ever since London!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以她才拍裸照给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's why she gave you a naked picture of herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.69,0:20:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样说得通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,录影机呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the video camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我架好录影机是为了引诱乔伊上钩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I set up the video camera to try and entice Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我不吃这套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, sadly, I could not be enticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议  你还留下乔伊的内裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unbelievable! You really kept Joey's underwear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  你为什么这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生性下流\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟踪男人  留下他们的内裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I stalk guys and keep their underpants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在终于知道谁是恶心鬼了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I think we've all learned something about who's disgusting and who's not. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我要开始吃炸鸡了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Now, I'm going to get back to my bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只吃鸡皮  你们可以吃鸡肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm only eating the skin, so the chicken's up for grabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.67,0:21:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得很有道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really thought you making a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜后来被打断\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean y'know, until you got cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.51,0:21:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  那个摩妮卡哪里有病啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up with that girl Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.72,0:21:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁晓得  她不是我朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I didn't come with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息  各位  你们猜怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, everybody! Everybody, guess what!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说服卡尔下周考试\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just convinced Carl to give us a test next week!.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.85,0:21:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,考试\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Test?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开心点  有考试才有进步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on! Tests make us all better learners!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  应该考申论题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah! We should have essay questions!
